{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Also the sons of Machir son of Menasseh. Also</b> — to include Ephraim. How so? Yosef saw for Ephraim only sons of sons, but for Menasseh he saw even children to his sons' sons, for we find in the perasha of Pinchas that for Ephraim, sons of sons are listed by father's houses, while for Menasseh, children to sons' sons. And it is established for us: all those listed in the perasha of Pinchas by father's houses, for Ephraim and for Menasseh, were born in Yosef's lifetime."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:25.257067710Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}